@startuml
title Map Software - Class Diagram
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class User {
  - id
  - video_path
  + request_data_source()
}

class Sensor {
  - type
  - data
  + acquire_data(path)
}

class VisualOdometrySystem {
  - feature_extractor : FeatureExtractor
  - graph : Graph
  - robot : Robot
  - sensor : Sensor
  - trajectory
  + process(video_path, frame_interval_seconds)
  + plot_trajectory(positions)
  - _homogeneous_transform(rotation, translation)
}

class FeatureExtractor {
  - camera_matrix
  - nfeatures
  + extract_features(frame_0, frame_1)
  - _camera_matrix(frame)
}

class Robot {
  - pose
  + update_pose(relative_pose)
}

class Graph {
  - graph : nx.Graph
  + add_node(index, pose)
  + add_edge(start, end, transformation)
  + optimize_graph()
}

User --> Sensor : selects / supplies video source
VisualOdometrySystem *-- FeatureExtractor
VisualOdometrySystem *-- Graph
VisualOdometrySystem *-- Robot
VisualOdometrySystem *-- Sensor
VisualOdometrySystem --> FeatureExtractor : estimate motion
VisualOdometrySystem --> Robot : update pose
VisualOdometrySystem --> Graph : store poses/edges
VisualOdometrySystem --> Sensor : owns input abstraction

note right of Graph
Stores trajectory graph data.
No graph optimization or
loop-closure correction is implemented.
end note

note bottom of FeatureExtractor
Monocular translation has unknown
absolute scale.
end note
@enduml
